{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T16:36:12.343Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"897c90c1b80c3e3bf21a36a6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T16:36:12.343Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:36:12.343Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"R7 audit links the already-open upstream issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1576. Installed SDK 2026.10.24 BulkItemUpdateMutation.match accepts only a metadata key/value; BulkItemCloseMutation has no match or expectedItemHash/expectedHistoryHead. commitWorkspaceTransaction provides a workspace lease but ordinary native writers acquire item leases independently. mutateItemWithHistoryContext permits history reads inside its callback, but cannot compose a native lifecycle update under that same non-reentrant item lease. The internal runWithItemMutationPrecondition callback is synchronous and not a public SDK export. A beforeMutation hook can inspect history under the native item lease; SDK setActiveExtensionHooks replaces the full registry and offers no public additive scoped guard or registry snapshot. Disabling extensions as in a hook workaround would bypass existing policy/hooks and lose extension-owned runtime schema; hand-applying native update/close/hierarchy behavior would violate SDK adoption. Required public contract: native lifecycle/bulk expectedHistoryHead (length plus record hash), or expectedItemHash, checked under the existing item lease; alternatively an additive request-scoped transactional guard that preserves the active extension runtime. Native sync update sites and resolution agreement publication remain blocked on this contract; not marked fixed. A package-level fixed-clock boundary probe is being captured in disposable source copies with the real SDK."}]}],"before_hash":"07f2fac6231ad5e5c2e43cf06d9c1da857955105935bd9239d2e9bfc7f617495","after_hash":"e035445292c19d0b70384444ff835ce6c144016c286fb0928a79d91730c0f6ef","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d8bb15ec46d3ce76d7a00c0cb6ec081eae79dc8e24e995ce587de157a5b452f2"}
